{"description":"xdxdxd","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/1000175205.2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.jpg","summary":"We created a web page that makes information from NASA and other space agencies much easier to access. Through our project, \"Eärendel,\" users can explore an interactive map with real data on aridity, slope, mineral similarity, thermal range, and UV radiation. This tool is vital for younger generations who want to learn about future missions to the Moon or Mars, offering children an engaging experience to discover new experimentation sites.","details":"<p>&quot;Eärendel&quot; is an interactive web platform designed to centralize and simplify access to open data from NASA and other international space agencies. At its core, the application features an interactive map that visualizes critical environmental and geological parameters—including aridity, slope, mineral similarity, thermal range, and UV radiation—allowing users to explore and compare planetary analogue sites on Earth with conditions on the Moon and Mars.</p>","dataRefs":[["https://pds-geosciences.wustl.edu/missions/lro/","https://pds-geosciences.wustl.edu/missions/lro/"],["https://gibs.earthdata.nasa.gov/wmts/epsg3857/best/","https://gibs.earthdata.nasa.gov/wmts/epsg3857/best/"],["https://trek.nasa.gov/mars/#v=0.1&x={lon}&y={lat}&z=5...","https://trek.nasa.gov/mars/#v=0.1&x={lon}&y={lat}&z=5..."],["https://trek.nasa.gov/moon/#v=0.1&x={lon}&y={lat}&z=5...","https://trek.nasa.gov/moon/#v=0.1&x={lon}&y={lat}&z=5..."],["https://search.earthdata.nasa.gov/","https://search.earthdata.nasa.gov/"],["https://worldview.earthdata.nasa.gov/","https://worldview.earthdata.nasa.gov/"],["https://pds.nasa.gov/","https://pds.nasa.gov/"]],"projectRefs":[["https://opensciencedata.esa.int/","https://opensciencedata.esa.int/"],["https://gportal.jaxa.jp/gpr/index/index","https://gportal.jaxa.jp/gpr/index/index"],["https://donnees-data.asc-csa.gc.ca/en/dataset/radarsat1","https://donnees-data.asc-csa.gc.ca/en/dataset/radarsat1"],["https://www.nps.gov/crmo/","https://www.nps.gov/crmo/"],["https://mdrs.marssociety.org","https://mdrs.marssociety.org"],["https://donnees-data.asc-csa.gc.ca/en/dataset/rcm","https://donnees-data.asc-csa.gc.ca/en/dataset/rcm"]],"members":[{"name":"Leonardo Nicolas Camacho Marca","country":"Bolivia","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/ananyn.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":true},{"name":"GABRIEL FERNANDO FERNANDEZ ZURITA","country":"Bolivia","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/88630.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Alec Aguilar","country":"Bolivia","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/perfil_xzct4jN.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Mateo Sebastian Alcón Rosso","country":"Bolivia","avatar":null,"owner":false},{"name":"ADRIAN MATEO ROCABADO BALLESTEROS","country":"Bolivia","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/photo-blender.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.png","owner":false},{"name":"Cristian Arturo Camacho Marca","country":"Bolivia","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/Screenshot_2026-11-13_at_19-45-49_fa.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.png","owner":false}]}